{"title":"2009 USAMO Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_USAMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Given circles <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/d/cddbccf89c00e019e9878f87f8d6325697e3f2fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/e/7cef5fa7ec053472a6e471aaacb0c5927ce36b36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"13\" /> intersecting at points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/4/6a47ca0fe7cb276abc022af6ac88ddae1a9d6894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$X$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce58e4af225c93d08606c26554caaa5ae32edeba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/f/3ff9d2add1273f7f294d4f0318b0ed4340c07768.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\ell_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"13\" height=\"15\" /> be a line through the center of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/d/cddbccf89c00e019e9878f87f8d6325697e3f2fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"13\" /> intersecting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/e/7cef5fa7ec053472a6e471aaacb0c5927ce36b36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"13\" /> at points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" /> and let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/0/970a3f7a0a3b548d0684d391994a6366f8d71ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\ell_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"13\" height=\"15\" /> be a line through the center of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/e/7cef5fa7ec053472a6e471aaacb0c5927ce36b36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"13\" /> intersecting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/d/cddbccf89c00e019e9878f87f8d6325697e3f2fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"13\" /> at points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff43e84f8a3bcf7b6965f0a3248bc4d3a9d0cd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />.  Prove that if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/1/b31cab458dc17cdaa49b467c836004d1738cae97.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P, Q, R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"56\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> lie on a circle then the center of this circle lies on line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/7/2c7774174993ffa29a38cf577ae34d8e0a3a63cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$XY$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"33\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_USAMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/d/05d0bb1172cf128548aec51cabd885258e296e6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega_3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"17\" height=\"10\" /> be the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Circumcircle\" title=\"Circumcircle\">circumcircle</a> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/9/259d1d91a5687fe90489d9efeeab80c4de05cf5f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PQRS$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"54\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/c/96c42077f2a447ca548cdbfe63f1932e9866df3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> to be the radius of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/c/8fc80d5e036efbaf3de0e9dab053194a1e6676ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/d/29d2497c8595ac7c5d96326b5c0174cc44d77c8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"18\" height=\"15\" /> to be the center of the circle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/c/8fc80d5e036efbaf3de0e9dab053194a1e6676ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/5/7b551bc492aad851275b782dadb6c31d6277684c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i \\in \\{1,2,3\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"89\" height=\"18\" />. Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/9/f0937ede81ec8f60015799b03b6bd7007330cf55.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$SR$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/b/7ab17967324fc2b12349c0610c6c256f4c829162.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PQ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" /> are the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Radical_axis\" title=\"Radical axis\">radical axises</a> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/1/3216e8846eb44f1055c322fb5bd30169d5d62cec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"19\" height=\"15\" /> , <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/b/43b6f63aa2266ef1b39b31386bd17b28e25faaac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O_3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"20\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/e/5ee48e5d3968014ef1e27c31e56d2f7ea5f8cb1d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"20\" height=\"15\" /> , <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/b/43b6f63aa2266ef1b39b31386bd17b28e25faaac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O_3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"20\" height=\"15\" /> respectively. Hence, by <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Power_of_a_point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power of a point\">power of a point</a>(the power of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/1/3216e8846eb44f1055c322fb5bd30169d5d62cec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"19\" height=\"15\" /> can be expressed using circle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/e/7cef5fa7ec053472a6e471aaacb0c5927ce36b36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/d/05d0bb1172cf128548aec51cabd885258e296e6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega_3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"17\" height=\"10\" /> and the power of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/e/5ee48e5d3968014ef1e27c31e56d2f7ea5f8cb1d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"20\" height=\"15\" /> can be expressed using circle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/d/cddbccf89c00e019e9878f87f8d6325697e3f2fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/d/05d0bb1172cf128548aec51cabd885258e296e6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega_3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"17\" height=\"10\" />),\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/e/4ee0bec89f1a9c5dd34f0c3866c8f3966df4b964.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[O_1O_2^2 - r_2^2 = O_1O_3^2 - r_3^2\\]\" width=\"185\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/4/b94c3aed44cbdcbcc6a3e0adc13f60b044c221b7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[O_2O_1^2 - r_1^2 = O_2O_3^2 - r_3^2\\]\" width=\"185\" height=\"19\" />\nSubtracting these two equations yields that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/6/ac6c65a4d08509327186ae34f55d6cc5347b7ffe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O_1O_3^2 - r_1^2 = O_2O_3^2 - r_2^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"189\" height=\"21\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/b/43b6f63aa2266ef1b39b31386bd17b28e25faaac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O_3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"20\" height=\"15\" /> must lie on the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Radical_axis\" title=\"Radical axis\">radical axis</a> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/d/cddbccf89c00e019e9878f87f8d6325697e3f2fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"13\" /> , <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/e/7cef5fa7ec053472a6e471aaacb0c5927ce36b36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\omega_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>~AopsUser101\n</p><p>One needs to be careful of when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/1/3216e8846eb44f1055c322fb5bd30169d5d62cec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"19\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/e/5ee48e5d3968014ef1e27c31e56d2f7ea5f8cb1d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"20\" height=\"15\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/b/43b6f63aa2266ef1b39b31386bd17b28e25faaac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O_3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"20\" height=\"15\" /> lie on a line. \n</p><p>~Arcticturn\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_USAMO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:40%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_USAMO\" title=\"2009 USAMO\">2009 USAMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_USAMO_Problems\" title=\"2009 USAMO Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=27&amp;year=2009\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_USAMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2009 USAMO Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_USAMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2009 USAMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_USAMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2009 USAMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_USAMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2009 USAMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_USAMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2009 USAMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_USAMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2009 USAMO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=USAMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"USAMO Problems and Solutions\"> All USAMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017171142\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.031 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.050 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 269/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1284/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 56/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 7897/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.431      1 -total\n 55.78%    6.934      1 Template:USAMO_newbox\n 42.00%    5.221      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:8111:|#|:idhash:canonical and times